---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import { heatPumpServices } from '../data/heat-pumps';
import '../styles/heat-pumps.css';
---
<section class="section heat-pumps-section" id="heat-pumps" aria-labelledby="heat-pumps-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="heat-pumps-intro" data-reveal>
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="little-line"></span> HEAT PUMPS · CALGARY, AB</p>
        <h2 id="heat-pumps-title">Heat pump installation<br /><span class="muted">&amp; service in Calgary.</span></h2>
      </div>
      <p>Considering a heat pump for your property? 17 Mechanical HVAC/R Ltd. offers installation, service and maintenance. Talk to us about a new system, a replacement or the equipment you already use.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="heat-pump-grid">
      {heatPumpServices.map(service => <article class="heat-pump-card" id={service.id} data-reveal>
        <div class="heat-pump-card-title"><Icon name={service.icon} size={30} /><h3>{service.name}</h3></div>
        <p>{service.text}</p>
        <ul>{service.details.map(detail => <li><Icon name="check" size={17} />{detail}</li>)}</ul>
        <a class="text-link" href="#contact" data-service={service.name}>{service.action}<Icon name="diagonal" size={20} /></a>
      </article>)}
    </div>
    <div class="heat-pump-guidance" data-reveal>
      <div>
        <h3>Heating and cooling. Planned for your property.</h3>
        <p>A heat pump transfers heat to warm your space in winter and cool it in summer. The right system depends on your building, Calgary’s climate and your existing heating equipment. Cold-climate performance and backup heating should be part of the plan.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="https://natural-resources.canada.ca/energy-efficiency/energy-star/heating-cooling-heat-pump" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read NRCan’s heat pump guide<Icon name="diagonal" size={17} /><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>
      </div>
      <aside class="heat-pump-rebates" aria-labelledby="heat-pump-rebates-title">
        <p class="eyebrow">PLANNING YOUR UPGRADE</p>
        <h3 id="heat-pump-rebates-title">Heat pump rebates: check the latest details.</h3>
        <p>Canada announced the National Heat Pump Rebate in October 2026. Before booking an installation, check the official updates for launch dates, eligibility, equipment and application requirements. An installation enquiry is separate from program approval.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="https://www.canada.ca/en/environment-climate-change/news/2026/10/the-government-of-canada-is-supporting-new-measures-to-lower-energy-costs-and-reduce-emissions.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Official Government of Canada update<Icon name="diagonal" size={17} /><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>
        <p class="heat-pump-checked">Program information checked October 16, 2026.</p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
